{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the demo version of <strong>Bullet Yeeters</strong> \u2014 a chaotic third-person shooter where tiny agents with big guns turn oversized household rooms into wild battlegrounds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Experience explosive gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strap on a jetpack, dodge bullets mid-air, climb onto furniture, and ambush enemies from behind a toaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Customization and progression:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock early agents, try out different weapon types, and customize your gear. The demo lets you level up your account up to <strong>level 15</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Game modes to choose from:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into Free-for-All, capture control points, or play <i>The Floor is Lava</i> \u2014 chaos comes in many forms! Play solo or team up with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc38 <strong>Face off against bosses:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on your first giant boss battles \u2014 you'll need agility, firepower, and a bit of luck to survive the spectacle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708040?t=1747648289","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708040?t=1747648289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708040/840e778e61f861acc1f4b6480a25b3688bb8d0c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747648289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708040/840e778e61f861acc1f4b6480a25b3688bb8d0c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747648289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the demo version of <strong>Bullet Yeeters</strong> \u2014 a chaotic third-person shooter where tiny agents with big guns turn oversized household rooms into wild battlegrounds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Experience explosive gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strap on a jetpack, dodge bullets mid-air, climb onto furniture, and ambush enemies from behind a toaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Customization and progression:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock early agents, try out different weapon types, and customize your gear. The demo lets you level up your account up to <strong>level 15</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Game modes to choose from:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into Free-for-All, capture control points, or play <i>The Floor is Lava</i> \u2014 chaos comes in many forms! Play solo or team up with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc38 <strong>Face off against bosses:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on your first giant boss battles \u2014 you'll need agility, firepower, and a bit of luck to survive the spectacle.</p>","developers":["YEETERS TEAM"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3624020","name":"BULLET YEETERS"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708040/2baa505eee72cd7c66968841b360d5dd4aa3e3e1/header.jpg?t=1747648289","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong>